# Local cream motion recovery, varied groups and strawberry cursor

Status: DONE LOCAL
Milestone: M69 Responsive local cream movement and cursor replacement
Dependencies: 63_LOCAL_MASSIVE_RANDOM_CLUMPS.todo

## Purpose

Fix the reported frozen local preview, increase ambient movement1.5X, randomize
whether joined groups move together or apart, add more small droplets and replace
the native mouse pointer with a strawberry-cream blob/trail. The owner explicitly
selected LOCAL preview only, not the live website.

## Tasks

- [x] Reproduce stale blur state blocking Resume while the document has focus.
- [x] Recover safely on explicit input, focus, pageshow and visible-page return.
