- [x] Render a strawberry pointer/trail above page controls with click-through.
- [x] Hide native pointer only while its replacement is usable and rendered.
- [x] Preserve native pointer on pause, inactivity, reduced motion, touch and failure.
- [x] Complete exact1.5Xambient timing and random joined/divergent group behavior.
