## Acceptance criteria

- Real motion resumes after a missed focus-return event; no inactive-time catch-up.
- Ambient orbit/breathing1.5Xfaster, pointer/trail lag and dimensions unchanged.
- Random group behavior is stable per load, smooth in time and bounded on screen.
- Added small droplets are visible; large groups and12user-placement slots remain.
- Strawberry pointer is above glass/text/buttons, never intercepts clicks.
- No production cream integration, social posting or image-tool inspection.

